<title>USA: ICT Group says Q3 to be higher than 1995 Q3.</title>
<headline>ICT Group says Q3 to be higher than 1995 Q3.</headline>
<dateline>LANGHORNE, Pa. 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>ICT Group Inc said on Wednesday that it expects to post third-quarter revenues that are between 25 percent and 30 percent higher than in the same period in 1995.</p>
<p>The company also said the third-quarter revenues would be in line with this year's second quarter, when it reported revenues of about $18 million.</p>
<p>ICT Group did not immediately return a telephone call seeking the 1995 figures.</p>
</text>
